          "For a count query (e.g., 'how many patients have a specific condition?'), the global sensitivity is exactly 1, because adding or removing one person changes the count by at most 1.",
          "The algorithm samples noise using inverse transform sampling, applying the scale parameter to a uniform pseudo-random variable.",
