          "Deterministic sampling allows repeatable unit testing and audit verification while production environments utilize cryptographically secure random number generators.",
          "Applying calibrated Laplace perturbation guarantees that external analysts cannot infer whether a specific individual participated in the survey.",
          "Enterprise analytical gateways implement the Laplace mechanism to publish privacy-preserving business intelligence reports.",
